{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41158","headline":"听妓洞云歌 · 布燮","name":"听妓洞云歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵇叔夜，鼓琴饮酒无闲暇。\n若使当时闻此歌，抛掷广陵都不藉。\n刘伯伦，虚生浪死过青春。\n一饮一硕犹自醉，无人爲尔卜深尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"布燮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}